>  * How should I go about getting a cursed potion of gain level? I have a
>    bunch of gain level, actually, but I don't think any are cursed, and I
>    converted my only non-coaligned altar. Are there tricks to curse things
>    I haven't thought of?

I tend to avoid using cursed potions of gain level for this, since this
uses up valuable potions that could be giving me a HP / MP / general
awesomeness boost.  I tend to go for cursed scrolls of teleportation
instead, since teleport scrolls are real common, not to mention mostly
useless once you have teleportitis and TC (especially if you're a
fighter who won't be out of MP often).  As far as cursing them: I
believe, but am not certain, that if you wield a potion of water
(uncursed) and read an uncursed scroll of remove curse while confused,
the potion will be converted to either holy or unholy water, with a
50-50 shot at each.  So if you want to have some unholy water around,
do this trick until you get unholy water, then dip a couple other
potions of water into it and then use one for your spare tele scrolls
and stash one in case you need it later.  This also has the advantage
of not angering your god, although it obviously wastes some supplies.

